      <h1 class="text-balance">Herman Miller Aeron Size C Review</h1>
      <!-- tca-aio-capsule -->
      <p>Herman Miller Aeron Size C accommodates tall users 6'0" to 6'4" with lean to average builds. The fixed 18.5" seat depth suits this height range's thigh length, while PostureFit SL lumbar support addresses sacrum and lumbar spine simultaneously. Users above 6'4" should verify seat depth compatibility before purchasing.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-slide-up">
        In-depth evaluation for tall users (6 feet to 6 foot 6)
      </p>
    </div>
